  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Fund grant to ensure continuity of essential HIV-related commodities and services to Donetsk and Lugansk regions of Ukraine - Ukraine (01-Jul-2015-30-Jun-2017)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine, HIV, United Nations Children&apos;s Fund (UNICEF)This program has the following goals: Prevent disruptions in the delivery of essential HIV-Related commodities and services to Donetsk and Lugansk regions of Ukraine, which are affected by the military conflict and are not controlled by the Government of Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
